# final-run4: cold Final of the only server that scored above the Final energy cliff.
# Same forward path as run5, which served the 19.1 Final while its prefix cache was warm.
# Weights: AWQ W4A16. Decode: autoregressive, MTP off. Sequences: uncapped.
# Hybrid cache: explicit prefix caching with mamba state aligned to cache blocks.
# Tokens per step: image default (do not set --max-num-batched-tokens).
# Scheduler: FCFS. Attention kernel: image default. Power: card default, set by start.sh.
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.90
--max-model-len 40960
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser qwen3
--enable-prefix-caching
--mamba-cache-mode align
